== Example

Create the graphics object and list its properties.

``````matlab
f = figure('Visible', 'off');
ax = axes('Parent', f);
h = surface(ax, 'XData', 1:3, 'YData', 1:3, 'ZData', peaks(3));
names = properties(h);
close(f)
``````


